    back: 'Back',
    title: 'Projects',
    intro: 'Detailed project portfolio and technical highlights.',
    projectAddress: 'Project address',
    projects: [
      {
        id: 'deployment-of-a-full-body-motion-control-algorithm-for-humanoid-robots',
        title: 'Deployment of a whole-body Control Algorithm for Humanoid Robots',
        date: 'Apr 10, 2026 - May 07, 2026',
        items: [
          'Motion retargeting: Performed secondary development based on the open-source GMR toolkit, completed kinematic adaptation for Walker Tienkung (1.73m, 65kg, 30-DoF), and successfully converted human motion capture data in npz, bvh, and fbx formats into executable pkl joint trajectories for the robot.',
          'Reinforcement learning training: Built a distributed parallel simulation environment with Isaac Lab/Gym and trained policies with PPO and AMP. Iteratively optimized reward design based on reward curve analysis, and validated Sim2Sim policy transfer in a high-fidelity MuJoCo environment.',
